---
description: Perforce changelist descriptions do not credit Cursor
alwaysApply: true
---

# Perforce commits

Do not add a Cursor co-author line to a Perforce changelist description. The description is only the change itself.

```
Prefer nullptr to NULL.
```

Do not append `Co-authored-by: Cursor`. Do not add `Made with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)` to a changelist description.
